# 1. Business Overview

LaunchForge Digital is a modern web design and development agency dedicated to helping local businesses establish a professional online presence through high-quality websites.

The agency provides affordable, responsive, SEO-friendly, and conversion-focused websites that enable businesses to attract customers, improve credibility, and increase revenue.

The agency website will function as the primary sales platform, portfolio, and lead-generation engine.

---

# 2. Business Problem Statement

Many local businesses face significant challenges due to the absence of a professional digital presence.

Common issues include:

* No website
* Outdated website design
* Poor mobile responsiveness
* Slow loading speed
* Low search engine visibility
* Lack of online credibility
* No lead capture mechanism
* No online booking capability
* Poor customer engagement

These limitations reduce customer acquisition and negatively impact business growth.

LaunchForge Digital addresses these challenges by delivering modern websites tailored to business objectives.

