# 17. Definition of Business Success

The agency website succeeds when it consistently attracts qualified visitors, establishes trust within seconds, generates high-quality leads, converts prospects into paying clients, and serves as a compelling demonstration of the agency's technical and design capabilities.

It should become both the company's primary marketing asset and its strongest portfolio piece, capable of supporting long-term growth into a full-service digital and AI solutions agency.
